<title>USA: TABLE - Park-Ohio Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Park-Ohio Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except per Share Data)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						 June 30	June 30</p>
<p>					 1997    1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales		     $103,785 $90,693 $197,591 $181,547</p>
<p> Gross profit		    16,820  15,431   31,863   30,960</p>
<p>Income from continuing operations</p>
<p>   before income taxes	  4,919   4,112    8,477    8,277</p>
