<p>Income from continuing operations</p>
<p>					3,035   2,550    5,277    5,132</p>
<p>Discontinued operations, net of tax</p>
<p>					    0   1,326	  0    2,825</p>
<p> Net income			 3,035   3,876    5,277    7,957</p>
<p>Per common share:</p>
<p>    Continuing operations	0.28    0.23     0.48     0.46</p>
<p>    Discontinued operations    0.00    0.12     0.00     0.26</p>
<p>    Net income		     0.28    0.35     0.48     0.72</p>
<p>Common shares used in the</p>
<p>   computation		   10,953  11,112   10,972   11,002</p>
<p>Note A -- On July 31, 1996, the company completed the sale of substantially all of the assets of Bennett Industries Inc, a wholly-owned unit which manufactures plastic containers for $50.8 million in cash, resulting in a pretax gain of $13.8 million recognized in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Note B -- On June 26, 1997, the company commenced its cash tender offer for all the outstanding shares of common stock of Arden Industrial Products Inc for about $43 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
